{"type":"FeatureCollection","features":[{"id":"1759249151175307044202611230518_fea1-3030","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-133.00380832,54.31185858],[-133.15742296,54.25409176],[-133.29542006,53.94944081],[-133.11316029,53.51590462],[-132.85302595,53.39942246],[-132.80130348,53.17620544],[-132.23128756,52.73880979],[-131.7307634,52.41258727],[-131.28406836,52.04332752],[-131.03267495,51.88817173],[-131.08491774,52.10710954],[-131.14103735,52.14122465],[-131.28109408,52.24398402],[-131.31305103,52.25367183],[-131.49404297,52.41241733],[-131.62111429,52.47393433],[-132.02362939,52.86002134],[-132.03818073,52.97001607],[-132.05674954,52.981803],[-132.34550129,53.16379857],[-132.32273143,53.35092435],[-132.72578385,53.60642784],[-132.80109644,53.68422616],[-132.92262804,53.80901867],[-132.98938634,53.83021464],[-132.94807952,54.01247969],[-132.97871517,54.10551488],[-133.00380832,54.31185858]]]},"properties":{"alert_code":"CFW","alert_type":"warning","alert_name_en":"coastal flooding warning","alert_name_fr":"avertissement de submersion c\u00f4ti\u00e8re","alert_short_name_en":"Coastal flooding","alert_short_name_fr":"Submersion c\u00f4ti\u00e8re","publication_datetime":"2026-11-25T20:01:38.806Z","expiration_datetime":"2026-11-26T12:01:38.806Z","validity_datetime":"2026-11-25T19:56:00.000Z","event_end_datetime":"2026-11-27T01:00:00.000Z","alert_text_en":"This warning is in effect for parts of the coast due to the following hazard(s): \n- Moderate storm surge\n- Large waves\n- Very high tides\n- Higher than normal water levels\n\nModerate flooding along coastlines and low-lying areas due to storm surge, large waves and high tides.\n\nWhat:\nCoastal flooding due to storm surge and large waves coinciding with king tides.\n\nWhen:\nDuring high tides today and Thursday.\n\nAdditional information:\nA strong frontal system will track across the B.C. coast tonight and Thursday, bringing storm surge and large waves. This will coincide with king tides, elevating water levels 30 to 50 cm higher than astronomical tides to produce moderate to significant coastal flooding.\n\nConsult tides.gc.ca for local tide calendars.\n\nUnsafe driving conditions due to flooded roads and/or debris, such as driftwood and rocks, is possible. Coastal erosion is likely in sensitive areas, such as tidal flats, estuaries, dunes, beaches or barrier islands. Ground floors of some properties and parts of communities may be affected by flooding.\n\nResidents should take immediate action to protect life and property. Heed advice from emergency management organizations. Prepare your property by moving valuables and harmful chemicals from your basement or crawl space to safe, elevated locations. Secure loose objects that may be carried away by water. Stay away from the shore to prevent being swept off rocks, injured by heavy objects such as rocks or driftwood or pulled out to sea.\n\nPlease continue to monitor alerts and forecasts issued by Environment Canada. To report severe weather, send an email to BCstorm@ec.gc.ca or post reports on social media using #BCStorm.","alert_text_fr":"Cet avertissement est en vigueur pour certaines parties de la c\u00f4te en raison des dangers suivants :\n- Onde de temp\u00eate mod\u00e9r\u00e9e\n- Vagues grandes\n- Mar\u00e9es tr\u00e8s hautes\n- Niveaux d'eau plus \u00e9lev\u00e9s que la normale\n\nInondations mod\u00e9r\u00e9es le long des c\u00f4tes et dans les basses-terres en raison d'une onde de temp\u00eate, de grosses vagues et des mar\u00e9es hautes.\n\nQuoi :\nInondations c\u00f4ti\u00e8res caus\u00e9es par une onde de temp\u00eate et de grosses vagues co\u00efncidant avec de grandes mar\u00e9es.\n\nQuand :\n\u00c0 mar\u00e9e haute aujourd'hui et jeudi.\n\nRenseignements suppl\u00e9mentaires :\nUn fort syst\u00e8me frontal traversera la c\u00f4te de la Colombie-Britannique ce soir, cette nuit et jeudi, ce qui occasionnera une onde de temp\u00eate et de grosses vagues. Le tout co\u00efncidera avec de grandes mar\u00e9es, de sorte que les niveaux d'eau d\u00e9passeront les mar\u00e9es astronomiques de 30 \u00e0 50 cm et entra\u00eeneront des inondations c\u00f4ti\u00e8res mod\u00e9r\u00e9es \u00e0 importantes.\n\nConsultez le site marees.gc.ca pour conna\u00eetre les calendriers des mar\u00e9es locales.\n\nDes conditions routi\u00e8res dangereuses sont possibles en raison des routes inond\u00e9es ou de la pr\u00e9sence de d\u00e9bris, tels que du bois flott\u00e9 et des rochers. De l\u2019\u00e9rosion c\u00f4ti\u00e8re est probable dans les zones vuln\u00e9rables, telles que les battures, les estuaires, les dunes, les plages ou les \u00eeles-barri\u00e8res. Les rez-de-chauss\u00e9e de certaines propri\u00e9t\u00e9s et certaines parties des communaut\u00e9s pourront \u00eatre touch\u00e9s par les inondations.\n\nPrenez imm\u00e9diatement des mesures pour prot\u00e9ger votre vie et votre propri\u00e9t\u00e9 et suivez les consignes des autorit\u00e9s en gestion des urgences. Pr\u00e9parez votre propri\u00e9t\u00e9 en d\u00e9pla\u00e7ant les objets de valeur et les produits chimiques nocifs de votre sous-sol ou de votre vide sanitaire vers des endroits s\u00fbrs et sur\u00e9lev\u00e9s. Fixez les objets non arrim\u00e9s qui pourraient \u00eatre emport\u00e9s par l\u2019eau. \u00c9loignez-vous du rivage pour \u00e9viter d\u2019\u00eatre emport\u00e9s par l\u2019eau depuis les rochers, bless\u00e9s par des objets lourds tels que des rochers ou du bois flott\u00e9 ou entra\u00een\u00e9s vers le large.\n\nVeuillez continuer \u00e0 surveiller les alertes et les pr\u00e9visions \u00e9mises par Environnement Canada. Pour signaler du temps violent, envoyez un courriel \u00e0 meteoBC@ec.gc.ca ou publiez un message sur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux en utilisant #BCMeteo.","risk_colour_en":"yellow","risk_colour_fr":"jaune","confidence_en":null,"confidence_fr":null,"impact_en":null,"impact_fr":null,"feature_name_en":"Western Coastline of Haida Gwaii","feature_name_fr":"littoral ouest de Haida Gwaii","province":"BC","status_en":"ended","status_fr":"termin\u00e9","feature_id":"fea1-3030"}},{"id":"141467989311626202611250502_fea1-2318","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-126.69000244,50.18999863],[-126.68866617,50.18887169],[-126.67602539,50.1782074],[-126.59959412,50.11371994],[-126.59855355,50.11284356],[-126.59841972,50.11273084],[-126.56408274,50.08378573],[-126.52317047,50.04923248],[-126.44894639,49.98516749],[-126.44421631,49.98116692],[-126.37175751,49.92002869],[-126.2953186,49.85554123],[-126.21888733,49.79105759],[-126.18492636,49.76243579],[-126.14867704,49.7318317],[-126.14571388,49.72932754],[-126.14252006,49.72662805],[-126.14154534,49.69070843],[-126.14144288,49.68692934],[-126.14138076,49.68449623],[-126.14134299,49.68301654],[-126.14127524,49.68036266],[-126.14125299,49.67949101],[-126.14124724,49.67926568],[-126.14123697,49.67925087],[-126.14123153,49.67924301],[-126.14121067,49.67921288],[-126.14112878,49.67764494],[-126.14112475,49.67756769],[-126.12982935,49.67576606],[-126.12416216,49.67744184],[-126.12033459,49.67987158],[-126.11679425,49.68148948],[-126.1156626,49.68200658],[-126.11514823,49.68504982],[-126.11553193,49.68674087],[-126.11594211,49.68809714],[-126.11850483,49.68975204],[-126.1201095,49.69296653],[-126.11280054,49.68928916],[-126.11158747,49.6870423],[-126.11317438,49.68448264],[-126.10057062,49.67044455],[-126.09891221,49.66608892],[-126.09852903,49.66508244],[-126.09751154,49.66254175],[-126.09746275,49.66254146],[-126.09708059,49.66253483],[-126.09451068,49.66249023],[-126.09201455,49.663892],[-126.078278,49.67160344],[-126.07818265,49.67165695],[-126.07766064,49.67195641],[-126.07761666,49.67191739],[-126.07759504,49.67192952],[-126.07755683,49.6718643],[-126.07700747,49.67137688],[-126.07667132,49.67109291],[-126.07544634,49.67005807],[-126.07535826,49.66998365],[-126.07390595,49.66875667],[-126.07387517,49.66873067],[-126.07373924,49.66861583],[-126.06601715,49.6620903],[-1