short_name_fr":"M\u00e9t\u00e9orologique sp\u00e9cial","publication_datetime":"2026-11-26T05:00:41.284Z","expiration_datetime":"2026-11-26T21:00:41.284Z","validity_datetime":"2026-11-27T09:00:00.000Z","event_end_datetime":"2026-11-28T02:00:00.000Z","alert_text_en":"Possible freezing rain event on Friday\n\nWhat: Freezing rain capable of making surfaces slippery\n\nWhen: Friday\n\nWhere: Outaouais, North Shore of Montreal, Laurentians, Lanaudi\u00e8re, Mauricie, Quebec City region, Beauce, Saguenay and Lower St Lawrence\n\nAdditional information:\n\nA warm front may bring a few hours of freezing rain beginning early Friday morning over the Outaouais and Montreal's North Shore. The area of freezing precipitation may then extend eastward during the day.\n\nThe intensity and duration of the freezing precipitation remain uncertain. Travel may become difficult at times due to slippery roadways and sidewalks.\n\nPlease continue to monitor alerts and forecasts issued by Environment Canada. To report severe weather, send an email to QCstorm@ec.gc.ca or post reports on social media using #QCStorm.","alert_text_fr":"\u00c9pisode de pluie vergla\u00e7ante possible vendredi\n\nQuoi : pluie vergla\u00e7ante pouvant rendre les surfaces glissantes\n\nQuand :  vendredi\n\nO\u00f9 : Outaouais, Rive-Nord de Montr\u00e9al, Laurentides, Lanaudi\u00e8re, Mauricie, r\u00e9gion de Qu\u00e9bec, Beauce, Saguenay et Bas-Saint-Laurent\n\nInformations suppl\u00e9mentaires :\n\nUn front chaud pourrait occasionner quelques heures de pluie vergla\u00e7ante \u00e0 compter de t\u00f4t vendredi matin sur l'Outaouais et la Rive-Nord de Montr\u00e9al. La zone de pr\u00e9cipitations vergla\u00e7antes pourrait ensuite s'\u00e9tendre vers l'est au cours de la journ\u00e9e.\n\nL'intensit\u00e9 et la dur\u00e9e des pr\u00e9cipitations vergla\u00e7antes demeurent incertaines. Les d\u00e9placements pourraient devenir difficiles par moments en raison des chauss\u00e9es et des trottoirs glissants.\n\nVeuillez continuer \u00e0 surveiller les alertes et les pr\u00e9visions \u00e9mises par Environnement Canada. Pour signaler du temps violent, envoyez un courriel \u00e0 meteoQC@ec.gc.ca ou publiez un message sur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux en utilisant #meteoqc.","risk_colour_en":null,"risk_colour_fr":null,"confidence_en":null,"confidence_fr":null,"impact_en":null,"impact_fr":null,"feature_name_en":"Amqui area","feature_name_fr":"secteur d'Amqui","province":"QC","status_en":"continued","status_fr":"maintenu","feature_id":"fea1-1026"}}],"numberMatched":213,"numberReturned":3,"links":[{"type":"application/geo+json","rel":"self","title":"This document as GeoJSON","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?f=json&limit=3"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"application/ld+json","title":"This document as RDF (JSON-LD)","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?f=jsonld&limit=3"},{"type":"text/html","rel":"alternate","title":"This document as HTML","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?f=html&limit=3"},{"type":"application/geo+json","rel":"next","title":"Items (next)","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?offset=3&limit=3"},{"type":"application/json","title":"Weather Alerts","rel":"collection","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts"}],"timeStamp":"2026-11-26T07:40:57.246885Z"}